area: config
case: 48-bool-for-int
verification: explicit-divergence
oracle: python
projection: config
reason: the port refuses a boolean where the key declares a number: pydantic reads [true] as [1], while TOML has a boolean type with two words and this loader takes only those. D-E in plans/duplication-and-simplification-plan.md records why. The extractor-default difference every other config golden records is folded into the refusal.
